  "slug": "water-damage-policy-change-request-form",
  "title": "Water Damage Policy Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "A decision-ready water damage policy change request that preserves identity, facts, evidence, authorization, exceptions, and accountable handoff without replacing the controlling policy or qualified judgment.",
  "description": "An original water damage policy change request for water source, migration path, and affected materials with domain-specific intake, investigation, evidence, decision, escalation, audit, and closeout controls.",
  "use_case": "Use when the water-loss claim and mitigation coordination owner must open and control a policy change request for water source, migration path, and affected materials. The record closes only after evidence and limitations are visible, authorized decisions are distinguishable from pending review, exceptions have owners, and the next recipient accepts the handoff.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
